---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
import SectionHeader from "../components/SectionHeader.astro";
---

<Layout title="Privacy · FSX REMOTE CONTROL" description="Privacy policy for FSX REMOTE CONTROL, a personal-use Google API client.">
  <nav class="fixed top-0 left-0 right-0 z-50 bg-bg/80 backdrop-blur-md border-b border-border">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6 h-12 flex items-center justify-between">
      <a href="/" aria-label="Home" class="text-accent hover:text-text transition-colors inline-flex items-center"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="w-5 h-5"><path d="m3 9 9-7 9 7v11a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2z"/><polyline points="9 22 9 12 15 12 15 22"/></svg></a>
      <a href="/" class="text-text-muted hover:text-accent text-xs transition-colors">← back</a>
    </div>
  </nav>

  <main class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6 pt-24 pb-16">
    <SectionHeader title="Privacy" />

    <div class="pl-6 border-l border-border space-y-5 mt-8 text-text-muted leading-relaxed">
      <p>
        <span class="text-text">FSX REMOTE CONTROL</span> is a personal-use Google OAuth client.
        Frederico Santos uses it only to reach his own Google accounts (Drive, Docs, Sheets, Slides, Gmail, Calendar, Tasks,
        Contacts, Forms, Apps Script, Photos, YouTube) from command-line tools on his own computers.
      </p>
      <p>
        It is not offered to the public. It has no server: Google data goes directly from Google to the
        owner's machines and is not sent to, stored by, or shared with anyone else.
      </p>
      <p>
        Access tokens are stored only in local configuration files on those machines. Access can be revoked at any time at
        <a href="https://myaccount.google.com/permissions" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="text-accent hover:text-text transition-colors underline underline-offset-2">myaccount.google.com/permissions</a>.
      </p>
      <p>
        Use of information received from Google APIs adheres to the
        <a href="https://developers.google.com/terms/api-services-user-data-policy" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="text-accent hover:text-text transition-colors underline underline-offset-2">Google API Services User Data Policy</a>,
        including the Limited Use requirements. Google data is not used for advertising, not sold, and not used to train AI models.
      </p>
      <p>
        Contact:
        <a href="mailto:frederico.santos.webpage@fsx.app" class="text-accent hover:text-text transition-colors underline underline-offset-2">frederico.santos.webpage@fsx.app</a>
      </p>
    </div>
  </main>
</Layout>
